{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0284_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "bb524ac53b1f3dff6359d4338005ac5d090fa034ca64cbd6a30771e677c267ce", "ja": "いえ、サイズはピッタリです。\n着心地もすごくいいんですが……あの。", "zh": "不，尺寸正合适。\n穿起来也很舒服……只是，那个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0284_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "f5757517953d39a25f62adb156eb865bed1a69af5ef47bc6977f94ad479fa9d9", "ja": "本当に、私でいいんでしょうか。こういう系統の衣装は\n風花さんや百瀬さんのような方のほうが……。", "zh": "真的，让我穿这个真的合适吗？这种风格的服装，还是更适合风花小姐或百濑小姐那样的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0284_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cb52ed2f109720b4a10452eff99f28e74e21343a9b20cbc2713cbfbbba4fbfec", "ja": "そうか？　すごく似合ってると思うけど。\nこうして見ると、千早で良かったって改めて思うよ。", "zh": "是吗？我觉得非常适合你啊。\n这样一看，我再次觉得由千早来演出真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0284_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "db01074cd55b924795cb521660b84c1e18657279d680906b9a188a57d6a1595c", "ja": "本当ですか？\nそれなら、いいんですけど……。", "zh": "真的吗？\n那样的话，就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
