{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0284_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "3160b68f29abe9660dda82b9ca2e9151d4043b00aecd02246f8f2705f225ce50", "ja": "あ、そういう狙いで……\nなるほど、それならば納得です。", "zh": "啊，原来是出于这样的考虑……\n这样啊，那我就理解了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
