{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0284_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "451fd83817bcecf6a20003f5e46053050a7117268838fe0b759df533102f3da3", "ja": "いえ、気にしないでください。\nそれよりも……。", "zh": "不，请别放在心上。\n比起那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
